   150|<body>
   151|<div class="stars" id="starsBg"></div>
   152|<div class="petals" id="petalContainer"></div>
   153|<header>
   154|  <div><h1><span class="hc">🌸</span> Galgame 年鉴</h1></div>
   155|  <p class="sub">✨ 15部精品 · 阿罗娜整理 · VNDB/2DFan · 试运行 ✨</p>
   156|  <button class="theme-btn" onclick="switchTheme()" title="切换主题">🎨</button>
   157|</header>
   158|<div class="container">
   159|<div class="search-box">
   160|  <div class="s-row">
   161|    <div class="s-wrap"><input class="s-in" id="searchInput" placeholder="🔍 搜索游戏名 / 开发商 / 角色名…" autocomplete="off"><div class="ac-dd" id="acDropdown"></div></div>
   162|    <select class="fs" id="filterYear"><option value="">📅 年份</option></select>
   163|    <select class="fs" id="filterPlatform"><option value="">💻 平台</option><option value="PC">PC</option><option value="Switch">Switch</option><option value="PS4">PS4</option><option value="PS5">PS5</option><option value="Mobile">手机</option></select>
   164|    <select class="fs" id="filterDev"><option value="">🏢 开发商</option></select>
   165|    <button class="btn btn-p" onclick="applyFilters()">🔍</button>
   166|    <button class="btn btn-r" onclick="resetFilters()">🔄</button>
   167|  </div>
   168|  <p class="rc">📦 共 <span id="gameCount">0</span> 部作品</p>
   169|</div>
   170|<div class="games-grid" id="gamesGrid"></div>
   171|<div class="no-r" id="noResults" style="display:none"><div class="ic">😿</div><p>没有找到～换个关键词试试？</p></div>
   172|</div>
   173|<h2 class="rs-title">🔗 友情站点</h2>
   174|<div class="rs-grid" id="resourceSites"></div>
   175|<div class="mo" id="modalOverlay" onclick="closeModalOutside(event)"><div class="modal" id="modal"><div class="mh"><div><h2 id="modalTitle"></h2><span class="tj" id="modalTitleJp"></span></div><button class="mc" onclick="closeModal()">✕</button></div><div class="mb" id="modalBody"></div></div></div>
   176|<div class="music-bar" id="musicBar">
   177|  <span class="mtitle" id="mTitle">🎵 点击圆点选歌</span><span class="mdots" id="mDots"></span>
   178|  <button class="mbtn" onclick="prevTrack()">⏮</button><button class="mbtn play" id="mPlay" onclick="togglePlay()">▶</button><button class="mbtn" onclick="nextTrack()">⏭</button>
   179|  <button class="mbtn" id="mMode" onclick="toggleMode()" title="播放模式">🔁</button>
   180|  <button class="mbtn" id="mMute" onclick="toggleMute()" title="静音">🔊</button>
   181|  <input type="range" id="mVol" min="0" max="100" value="50" oninput="setVol(this.value)" style="width:60px;accent-color:var(--pink);flex-shrink:0">
